==Battleground==
*4 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 1.67~2 seconds<sup>50f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>, delay 40~50 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Teacher Bun Bun]]s spawn after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns after 22.67 seconds<sup>680f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall the first Shy Boys with [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] and 3-4 meatshields. Spawn [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to kill a few Shy Boys for money then deploy [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to quickly get rid of the rest. When the Bun Buns arrive, just use Sanzo Cat, [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and other [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] cats to kill them.

